                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="2176 2615 411 2615 411 2652 411 2667 2185 2667 2185 2652 2185 2630 2176 2615"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="back, not to speak of drawing it with a rope over the snow. The seats of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-119_l35" HPOS="409" VPOS="2667" WIDTH="1680" HEIGHT="71" BASELINE="411 2708 2089 2714" TAGREFS="TYPE_4">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="411 2708 409 2721 1024 2736 1026 2736 1489 2727 1528 2738 1531 2738 1533 2738 2087 2727 2089 2714 2089 2684 2057 2671 2055 2671 1962 2671 1959 2671 1957 2671 1955 2671 1942 2682 1593 2671 1591 2671 1528 2682 1448 2669 1446 2669 1370 2682 1117 2682 1102 2669 1100 2669 1097 2669 1095 2669 1093 2669 1065 2680 926 2680 896 2667 894 2667 892 2667 890 2667 844 2678 829 2667 827 2667 825 2667 822 2667 820 2667 777 2678 664 2667 662 2667 660 2667 636 2678 621 2667 619 2667 617 2667 615 2667 612 2667 584 2678 513 2667 511 2667 411 2675 411 2708"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="driving-sledges, of whatever shape, are usually supplied with a low back."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
